1
00:00:01,199 --> 00:00:04,200
Bugs and Butterflies with Mimo!

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:11,098
Mimo: Hi friends! Let's go on a bug hunt in my garden! Lots of little bugs live here.

3
00:00:11,398 --> 00:00:14,688
Lulu: Let's look very carefully. Bugs are tiny!

4
00:00:16,388 --> 00:00:21,898
Mimo: Bzzz! It's a bee! Bees are yellow and black, and they make honey!

5
00:00:22,198 --> 00:00:25,649
Mimo: Can you buzz like a bee? Bzzzz!

6
00:00:28,853 --> 00:00:32,048
Bruno: Honey? Did somebody say honey? Bears love honey!

7
00:00:35,748 --> 00:00:42,466
Mimo: Look! A butterfly! Butterflies have big, beautiful wings. Flap, flap, flap!

8
00:00:42,766 --> 00:00:44,544
Mimo: Can you say butterfly?

9
00:00:46,444 --> 00:00:48,877
Lulu: Let's flap our wings like a butterfly!

10
00:00:52,577 --> 00:01:02,510
Mimo: This is a ladybug! Ladybugs are red with black spots. Let's count the spots! One, two, three, four, five, six!

11
00:01:02,810 --> 00:01:04,598
Mimo: Can you say ladybug?

12
00:01:07,898 --> 00:01:14,792
Mimo: Here's an ant! Ants are tiny, but they're super strong. They work together as a team!

13
00:01:15,092 --> 00:01:16,590
Mimo: Can you say ant?

14
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:20,304
Bruno: I'm super strong too! Look!

15
00:01:22,004 --> 00:01:24,085
Bruno: Phew! Being strong is hard work!

16
00:01:25,785 --> 00:01:32,452
Mimo: This is a snail. Snails carry a shell on their back, and they move very, very slowly.

17
00:01:32,752 --> 00:01:34,248
Mimo: Can you say snail?

18
00:01:36,966 --> 00:01:38,443
Bruno: I'm... a... slow... snail.

19
00:01:39,922 --> 00:01:42,142
Pip: Look what I found! A wiggly worm!

20
00:01:43,842 --> 00:01:50,329
Mimo: That's not a worm, Pip! It's a caterpillar! Caterpillars munch on leaves all day long.

21
00:01:50,629 --> 00:01:52,322
Mimo: Can you say caterpillar?

22
00:01:54,222 --> 00:01:59,763
Mimo: And guess what? One day, a caterpillar turns into a beautiful butterfly!

23
00:02:00,063 --> 00:02:01,633
Pip: Wow! Magic!

24
00:02:01,933 --> 00:02:04,861
Bruno: Caterpillars munch all day? That's my kind of bug!

25
00:02:05,161 --> 00:02:08,354
Mimo: Let's say all the bugs we found! Ready?

26
00:02:08,654 --> 00:02:10,143
Bruno: Bee! Bzzz!

27
00:02:10,943 --> 00:02:11,994
Lulu: Butterfly!

28
00:02:12,794 --> 00:02:13,988
Mimo: Ladybug!

29
00:02:14,788 --> 00:02:15,139
Bruno: Ant!

30
00:02:15,939 --> 00:02:16,812
Pip: Snail!

31
00:02:17,612 --> 00:02:19,065
Lulu: Caterpillar!

32
00:02:20,665 --> 00:02:23,939
Mimo: Great bug hunting, friends! Bye bye!
